                differentiator is key governance:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                  <span>Use managed KMS keys for production data.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                  <span> Restrict who can decrypt, not just who can read.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                  <span> Rotate keys on a schedule and after incidents.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4">
                Also, define where encryption is enforced: databases, object
                storage, backups, queues, and analytics sinks.
              </p>
